 "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2026, "rank": 365, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2026, "rank": 109, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2026, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2025, "rank": 377, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2025, "rank": 109, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "americas-most-innovative-companies", "title": "America's Most Innovative Companies", "year": 2025, "rank": 252, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2025, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2024, "rank": 388, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500--financials", "title": "Fortune Sector Leaders: Financials", "year": 2024, "rank": 27, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2024, "rank": 110, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2024, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2023, "rank": 408, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2023, "rank": 111, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2022, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2022, "rank": 387, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "best-workplaces-financial-services-insurance", "title": "Best Large Workplaces in Financial Services and Insurance", "year": 2022, "rank": 49, "itemDescription": "Employees say:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI know that this company will always do the right thing, even when no one is looking. We have a long history of doing business the right way. We are in business to serve our policyowners and actually help them become more financially secure, which is a major challenge for most people - and they need our help. We're solving a problem in society and growing a thriving business in the meantime. This is an exceptional organization and I'm proud to be part of it.\u201d<br />\r\n<br />\r\n"}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2022, "rank": 97, "itemDescription": "<span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Demand for Northwestern Mutual\u2019s products continued to grow during the pandemic\u2019s second year. The company made $1.6 billion in new life insurance sales in 2021, up 52% from 2020, and recorded its highest-ever level of \u201cpolicy-owner persistency\u201d\u2014the number of customers who continued to renew their coverage. With $36.8 billion in revenue in 2021, the company also announced its largest-ever dividend, distributing $6.5 billion to shareholders.</span>"}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2021, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2021, "rank": 360, "itemDescription": "<span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;The deadly pandemic increased demand for life insurance, and privately held Northwestern Mutual has met that demand\u2014a fact that helped it pass the $1 billion mark in new life insurance premium sales in 2020. Its record $33.8 billion in revenue boosts the company 12 spots on the Fortune 500\u2014and makes Northwestern Mutual the largest company by revenue in Wisconsin. The Milwaukee-based life insurer also boosted headcount, client investment assets, and policyholder benefit payouts, which cut into margins: Its 2020 profits fell by nearly 67%.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:12673,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:2,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, Arial&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:11}\" data-sheets-textstyleruns=\"{&quot;1&quot;:0}\uee10{&quot;1&quot;:279,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;6&quot;:1}}\uee10{&quot;1&quot;:286}\">The deadly pandemic increased demand for life insurance, and privately held Northwestern Mutual has met that demand\u2014a fact that helped it pass the $1 billion mark in new life insurance premium sales in 2020. Its record $33.8 billion in revenue boosts the company 28 spots on the Global 500\u2014and makes Northwestern Mutual the largest company by revenue in the U.S. state of Wisconsin. The Milwaukee-based life insurer also boosted headcount, client investment assets, and policyholder benefit payouts, which cut into margins: Its 2020 profits fell by nearly 67%.</span>"}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2021, "rank": 90, "itemDescription": "<span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;The deadly pandemic increased demand for life insurance, and privately held Northwestern Mutual has met that demand\u2014a fact that helped it pass the $1 billion mark in new life insurance premium sales in 2020. Its record $33.8 billion in revenue boosts the company 12 spots on the Fortune 500\u2014and makes Northwestern Mutual the largest company by revenue in Wisconsin. The Milwaukee-based life insurer also boosted headcount, client investment assets, and policyholder benefit payouts, which cut into margins: Its 2020 profits fell by nearly 67%.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:12673,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;10&quot;:2,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, Arial&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:11}\" data-sheets-textstyleruns=\"{&quot;1&quot;:0}\uee10{&quot;1&quot;:279,&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;6&quot;:1}}\uee10{&quot;1&quot;:286}\">The deadly pandemic increased demand for life insurance, and privately held Northwestern Mutual has met that demand\u2014a fact that helped it pass the $1 billion mark in new life insurance premium sales in 2020. Its record $33.8 billion in revenue boosts the company 12 spots on the Fortune 500\u2014and makes Northwestern Mutual the largest company by revenue in Wisconsin. The Milwaukee-based life insurer also boosted headcount, client investment assets, and policyholder benefit payouts, which cut into margins: Its 2020 profits fell by nearly 67%.</span>"}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2020, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 388, "itemDescription": "The privately held life insurer is based in Milwaukee and was founded in 1857."}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 102, "itemDescription": "The privately held life insurer is based in Milwaukee and was founded in 1857."}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2019, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2019, "rank": 429, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2019, "rank": 111, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2018, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2018, "rank": 401, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2018, "rank": 104, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2017, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "global500", "title": "Fortune Global 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 378, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 97, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Compa